       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ADDSUB.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TEMP PIC 9(3).

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LS-NUM1 PIC 9(3).
       01 LS-NUM2 PIC 9(3).
       01 LS-RESULT PIC 9(3).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-NUM1 LS-NUM2 LS-RESULT.
       MAIN-PARA.
           COMPUTE LS-RESULT = LS-NUM1 + LS-NUM2.
           MOVE RETURN-CODE TO WS-TEMP.
           STOP RUN.
